<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>CFBundleDevelopmentRegion</key>
	<string>en</string>
	<key>CFBundleDisplayName</key>
	<string>Echoelmusic</string>
	<key>CFBundleExecutable</key>
	<string>$(EXECUTABLE_NAME)</string>
	<key>CFBundleIdentifier</key>
	<string>$(PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER)</string>
	<key>CFBundleInfoDictionaryVersion</key>
	<string>6.0</string>
	<key>CFBundleName</key>
	<string>Echoelmusic</string>
	<key>CFBundlePackageType</key>
	<string>APPL</string>
	<key>CFBundleShortVersionString</key>
	<string>$(MARKETING_VERSION)</string>
	<key>CFBundleVersion</key>
	<string>$(CURRENT_PROJECT_VERSION)</string>
	<key>LSRequiresIPhoneOS</key>
	<true/>
	<key>UIApplicationSceneManifest</key>
	<dict>
		<key>UIApplicationSupportsMultipleScenes</key>
		<false/>
	</dict>
	<key>UILaunchScreen</key>
	<dict/>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
	<key>UISupportedInterfaceOrientations~ipad</key>
	<array>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortrait</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationPortraitUpsideDown</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeLeft</string>
		<string>UIInterfaceOrientationLandscapeRight</string>
	</array>
	<key>UIUserInterfaceStyle</key>
	<string>Dark</string>
	<key>UIAppFonts</key>
	<array>
		<string>AtkinsonHyperlegible-Regular.ttf</string>
		<string>AtkinsonHyperlegible-Bold.ttf</string>
		<string>AtkinsonHyperlegible-Italic.ttf</string>
	</array>
	<!-- bluetooth-peripheral removed: no CBPeripheralManager exists in the app
	     (unbacked capability = Guideline 2.5.4 rejection risk). bluetooth-central
	     is used foreground for BLE HR straps (PolarH10BioPublisher, 0x180D);
	     kept for now — see task #27 for whether background BLE HR is wanted. -->
	<key>UIBackgroundModes</key>
	<array>
		<string>audio</string>
		<string>bluetooth-central</string>
	</array>
	<key>NSMicrophoneUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Echoel uses the microphone to turn live audio into sound, processed on your device. Audio is not recorded or sent anywhere unless you export it yourself.</string>
	<key>NSHealthShareUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Echoel reads heart rate and HRV to drive sound, image and light in real time. Data stays on your device for creative control and is never used for diagnosis; if you turn on OSC or ADM output, the current bio values are also sent over your local network to the devices you choose.</string>
	<key>NSHealthUpdateUsageDescription</key>
	<string>If you turn on "Save to Apple Health", Echoel writes the heart rate and respiratory rate it measures (camera or Bluetooth sensor) to Apple Health. This is off by default and you can turn it off anytime.</string>
	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Echoelmusic measures your pulse from your fingertip on the rear camera lens to drive bio-reactive music. No images are stored or transmitted.</string>
	<key>NSBluetoothAlwaysUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Echoelmusic connects to Bluetooth MIDI controllers and audio devices for professional music creation.</string>
	<key>NSBluetoothPeripheralUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Echoelmusic connects to Bluetooth MIDI controllers for music creation.</string>
	<key>NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription</key>
	<string>If you turn on "Place in session name", Echoel looks up your city once to stamp it into the session name (e.g. Echoel_2026-07-10_Hamburg_Am_72bpm_A440). This is off by default; the place name is resolved with Apple's geocoder and the result is not stored by Echoel or sent anywhere else.</string>
	<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
	<string>Echoelmusic uses the local network for Art-Net &amp; sACN lighting control and external audio interfaces, and — when you enable OSC or ADM output — to send live bio values (heart rate, HRV, breath, coherence) to the devices you choose.</string>
	<key>NSBonjourServices</key>
	<array>
		<string>_http._tcp</string>
		<string>_rtsp._tcp</string>
		<string>_artnet._udp</string>
		<string>_osc._udp</string>
		<string>_midi._udp</string>
		<string>_apple-midi._udp</string>
		<string>_echoelmusic._tcp</string>
		<string>_echoel-colab._tcp</string>
		<string>_echoel-colab._udp</string>
	</array>
	<key>ITSAppUsesNonExemptEncryption</key>
	<false/>
	<key>UIRequiresFullScreen</key>
	<false/>
	<key>UIStatusBarHidden</key>
	<true/>
	<key>UIViewControllerBasedStatusBarAppearance</key>
	<false/>
	<key>MinimumOSVersion</key>
	<string>18.0</string>
	<key>UIRequiredDeviceCapabilities</key>
	<array>
		<string>arm64</string>
	</array>
	<key>NSAppTransportSecurity</key>
	<dict>
		<!-- Required for local network devices: MIDI controllers, DMX fixtures, Art-Net -->
		<key>NSAllowsLocalNetworking</key>
		<true/>
		<!-- Localhost HTTP exception removed for production security -->
	</dict>
</dict>
</plist>
